  "prefLabel": "Rev 401.22 Property tax exemption",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 401.22 “Property tax exemption” means “exemption” as defined in RSA 72:29, namely “the amount of money to be deducted from the assessed valuation, for property tax purposes, of real property.” The term includes “exemption.”\n\nSource. #12027, eff 10-28-16; renumbered by #12925 (formerly Rev 401.21)",
